WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.517
A beginner's guide

00:00:01.341 --> 00:00:02.319
to running local

00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:03.274
AI at home

00:00:03.798 --> 00:00:05.224
GPU Partner walks

00:00:05.036 --> 00:00:05.861
through serving a

00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:06.993
quantized model with

00:00:06.935 --> 00:00:08.432
Unsloth Desktop on

00:00:08.244 --> 00:00:09.399
