00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:27.709
fits

00:00:28.238 --> 00:00:29.440
Setup takes about

00:00:29.252 --> 00:00:30.867
10-15 minutes plus

00:00:30.679 --> 00:00:31.386
downloads

00:00:31.493 --> 00:00:32.683
with no terminal

00:00:32.519 --> 00:00:33.792
or Python needed

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:35.340
Full story on

00:00:35.151 --> 00:00:36.047
the dashboard
